[en.FOCUS_C18_111_TECHNOLOGY]
Botanical Technology

[en.FOCUS_C18_111_TECHNOLOGY_desc]
The legacy of the research on the foal’s breath have led the Kirins’ technological development astray: the Kirins have a high level of expertise in botany, and they can use the growth characteristics of plants to create various wonderful pollens, fruits, and vines.\nOn the other hand, the Kirins’ technological development in other fields is relatively backward, and their research in fields such as machinery and electronics has almost stagnated. This unbalanced technological development makes the Kirins somewhat powerless when facing external threats.\nPerhaps, we can use the advantages of botanical technology to make up for the shortcomings in other fields: for example, the Agricultural Bureau has just discovered that the pollen of a plant seems to be able to conduct magic and electricity...

[zh.FOCUS_C18_111_TECHNOLOGY]
植物学科技

[zh.FOCUS_C18_111_TECHNOLOGY_desc]
稚马之息种植研究的遗留，似乎让麒麟们的科技发展走入了歧途：麒麟们在植物学上有着极高的造诣，他们能够利用植物的生长特性，制造出各种奇妙的花粉、果实、藤蔓。\n但另一方面，麒麟们在其他领域的科技发展却相对滞后，他们对于机械、电子等领域的研究几乎停滞不前。这种科技发展的不均衡，使得麒麟们在面对外部威胁时，显得有些力不从心。\n或许，我们可以借助植物学科技的优势，来弥补其他领域的不足：例如，农业局刚刚发现了一种植物的花粉似乎可以传导魔法和电流...

